      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.36,
      "end_seconds": 19.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.78,
      "text": "Um, um, so... sharp pain low on one side. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
